      "type": "text",
      "title": "Signed in as",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### ${__user.login}\n\n| User | Group | Policy |\n|---|---|---|\n| alice | `order-team` | `order-service` only; metric label `customer_id` denied |\n| bob | `payment-team` | `payment-service` only |\n| carol | `platform-admins` | everything (unrestricted) |\n\nEverything on this page is fetched through Querdian with your own token."
